// Declared inputs (plan P3-31; design T9 A7): blobs a host gives a document
// before Ingest — part of its identity (a fork copies them), never shown to
// a script, each read by a validating decoder (fuzz target fuzz_inputs).
// INPUT(name, version, schema, consumer stage)
//   labels: the other documents' labels products (a JSON array of them;
//           semantic/manifest.h), read by Resolve
INPUT(labels, 1, LabelManifestList, Resolve)
//   mathFonts: a host's math fonts (plan P5-01; D-M06): .tsmf blobs back to
//           back (tools/mathc.py --tsmf), loaded into the process-wide math
//           font registry (by content hash) and named by math.fonts
INPUT(mathFonts, 1, TsmfList, Resolve)
